1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Your weekend does not
need more research.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,500
It needs one decision.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,000
Not the perfect event.
Not the optimal plan.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
One thing, chosen by 6pm,
that gets you out the door.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000
The bar is low on purpose: a coffee shop with your book counts.
A 45-minute event counts.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Decide once. Go.
Let the night be ordinary.

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,500
Try the Solo Night Generator. Three plans in ten seconds. Link in bio.
